      <p class="eyebrow">RepoPact Core</p>
      <h2 id="repopact-flow-title">A repository carries the operating context.</h2>
      <p>RepoPact connects scoped authority and work state to implementation evidence and durable history. This is one project's model, not a claim that every ForgeWire Labs product uses the same architecture.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ForgeWireLabs/repopact-core">Read the RepoPact Core documentation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
